#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Note: Qiskit bit ordering {#note-qiskit-bit-ordering}"
msgstr "Note : Ordre des bits dans Qiskit {#note-qiskit-bit-ordering}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit uses **Little Endian** notation when ordering qubits and bits, "
"meaning **qubit 0 is the rightmost bit** in the bitstrings. Example: "
"$|01\\rangle$ means q0 is $|1\\rangle$ and q1 is $|0\\rangle$. Be careful "
"because some literature in quantum computing use the Big Endian notation "
"(qubit 0 is the leftmost bit) and a great deal of quantum mechanics "
"literature does, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit utilise la notation **Little Endian** pour ordonner les qubits et les"
" bits, ce qui signifie que **le qubit 0 est le bit le plus à droite** dans "
"les chaînes de bits. Exemple : $|01\\rangle$ signifie que q0 est "
"$|1\\rangle$ et q1 est $|0\\rangle$. Fais attention car certaines références"
" en calcul quantique utilisent la notation Big Endian (le qubit 0 est le bit"
" le plus à gauche), et une grande partie de la littérature en mécanique "
"quantique aussi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Another thing to notice is that when representing a quantum circuit, $|q_0\\rangle$ is always placed at the top of the circuit.\n"
"With this in mind, the quantum state of the above circuit can be written as a tensor product of single-qubit quantum state.\n"
msgstr ""
"Une autre chose à noter est que lors de la représentation d'un circuit quantique, $|q_0\\rangle$ est toujours placé en haut du circuit.\n"
"En gardant cela à l'esprit, l'état quantique du circuit ci-dessus peut s'écrire comme un produit tensoriel d'états quantiques à qubit unique.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$\n"
"|q1\\rangle \\otimes|q0\\rangle = (a|0\\rangle+b|1\\rangle) \\otimes (c|0\\rangle+d|1\\rangle)\n"
"$\n"
msgstr ""
"$\n"
"|q1\\rangle \\otimes|q0\\rangle = (a|0\\rangle+b|1\\rangle) \\otimes (c|0\\rangle+d|1\\rangle)\n"
"$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$\n"
"= ac|0\\rangle|0\\rangle+ad|0\\rangle|1\\rangle+bc|1\\rangle|0\\rangle+bd|1\\rangle|1\\rangle\n"
"$\n"
msgstr ""
"$\n"
"= ac|0\\rangle|0\\rangle+ad|0\\rangle|1\\rangle+bc|1\\rangle|0\\rangle+bd|1\\rangle|1\\rangle\n"
"$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$\n"
"= ac|00\\rangle+ad|01\\rangle+bc|10\\rangle+bd|11\\rangle\n"
"$\n"
msgstr ""
"$\n"
"= ac|00\\rangle+ad|01\\rangle+bc|10\\rangle+bd|11\\rangle\n"
"$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "( $|ac|^2+ |ad|^2+ |bc|^2+ |bd|^2=1$ )\n"
msgstr "( $|ac|^2+ |ad|^2+ |bc|^2+ |bd|^2=1$ )\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The initial state of Qiskit is $|0\\rangle|0\\rangle=|00\\rangle$, so by "
"applying $H$ to each qubit, it changes to a state of equal superposition.\n"
msgstr ""
"L'état initial de Qiskit est $|0\\rangle|0\\rangle=|00\\rangle$, donc en "
"appliquant $H$ à chaque qubit, il passe à un état de superposition égale.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$H|0\\rangle \\otimes "
"H|0\\rangle=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle) \\otimes "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle) = "
"\\frac{1}{2}(|00\\rangle+|01\\rangle+|10\\rangle+|11\\rangle)$\n"
msgstr ""
"$H|0\\rangle \\otimes "
"H|0\\rangle=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle) \\otimes "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle) = "
"\\frac{1}{2}(|00\\rangle+|01\\rangle+|10\\rangle+|11\\rangle)$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"=\\frac{1}{2}\\left( \\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix} \\otimes \\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix}\\right) = \\frac{1}{2}\\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix}=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix}+\\begin{pmatrix} 0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix}+\\begin{pmatrix} 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix}+\\begin{pmatrix} 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix}\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"=\\frac{1}{2}\\left( \\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix} \\otimes \\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix}\\right) = \\frac{1}{2}\\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix}=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix}+\\begin{pmatrix} 0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix}+\\begin{pmatrix} 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix}+\\begin{pmatrix} 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix}\\right)\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The measurement rule is also same as a single qubit case, the probability of"
" measuring $|00\\rangle$ is $|ac|^2$.\n"
msgstr ""
"La règle de mesure est également la même que pour un qubit unique : la "
"probabilité de mesurer $|00\\rangle$ est $|ac|^2$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
